OL,3,GNEWSA'Kind and wonderful Sir Patrick
OL,4,Awas my mentor'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Emmerdale actor Gemma Oaten has
OL,7,Fpaid tribute to her "mentor" Sir
OL,8,FPatrick Stewart, describing him as a
OL,9,F"kind and wonderful man".
OL,11,FMirfield-born Sir Patrick died on
OL,12,FWednesday aged 86 at his Los Angeles
OL,13,Fhome after "a brief and poignant
OL,14,Fjourney" with Alzheimer's disease and
OL,15,FLewy Body Dementia.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
