OL,3,GNEWSA'Kind and wonderful Sir Patrick
OL,4,Awas my mentor'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHull-born Oaten, who appeared in the
OL,7,FBritish soap as Rachel Breckle between
OL,8,F2011 and 2015, wrote to the Star Trek
OL,9,Fstar while at drama school in 2008 and
OL,10,Fthe pair met on numerous occasions over
OL,11,Fthe years, including backstage chats
OL,12,Fduring Sir Patrick's many theatre
OL,13,Fperformances.
OL,15,FAn emotional Oaten told BBC Radio
OL,16,FHumberside she was "trying to process"
OL,17,Fhis death.
